WEBVTT

00:00.500 --> 00:03.000
Morning on the Saltmere breakwater.

00:03.200 --> 00:05.800
The ferry leaves at seven,
as it has for forty years.

00:06.000 --> 00:08.000
<i><i>[gulls calling]</i></i>

00:08.200 --> 00:11.000
Tide's turning. We should check
the mooring buoys.

00:11.200 --> 00:14.000
The lighthouse keeper logs
every boat that passes.

00:14.200 --> 00:16.500
<i><i>♪ brass band playing ♪</i></i>

00:16.800 --> 00:19.500
Harbour office, this is the pilot launch.

00:19.700 --> 00:22.000
Fog rolls in from the outer mole by noon.

00:22.200 --> 00:25.000
Keep to the marked channel
past the red buoy.

00:25.200 --> 00:28.000
By evening the quay is quiet again.
